type: sequence
title: OAuth 2.0 Code Flow

- Browser
  → Auth Server: GET /authorize?client_id=… [+]
- --- User authenticates
- Auth Server
  → Browser: 302 + code [-]
- Browser
  → Auth Server: POST /token (code) [+]
- Auth Server
  → Browser: { access_token, refresh_token } [-]
- --- API call
- Browser
  → API Server: GET /profile (Bearer token) [+]
- API Server
  → Auth Server: GET /introspect [+]
- Auth Server
  → API Server: { active: true, sub: "u42" } [-]
- API Server
  → Browser: { id, email, name } [-]
